        "text": "Since September 2024 Jason Obawemimo has been the founder of Obavia (previously Apohenia), where he audits business processes, builds AI-assisted workflows for intake, qualification, follow-up and CRM handoffs, and is developing Obavia, the sale desk he built at Triple J, as a product for Texas independent dealers. Since August 2024 he has co-owned and operated Triple J Auto Investment in Houston, where he runs daily operations (customer intake, vehicle pricing, inventory, scheduling, vendor coordination), negotiates prices and financing, and built software for the dealership and a former rental operation."
